Derivative changes (2026-10-07 to 2026-10-08), Bilingual Lite contributors:
- Shared viewport reader toolbar, explicit cancellable whole-work image translation,
  continuous normalized move/resize controls, and bounded comment preview actions.
- New lib/src/translation module and offline tests.
- Reader image overlays, title/comment bilingual translation and BYOK settings.
- Separate Android application identity and Windows product/data identity.
- API credentials in OS secure storage, excluded from normal configuration.
- Syncfusion charts removed; native_visit_chart.dart uses Flutter Canvas.
- Pinput/SmartAuth removed; local PIN entry uses Flutter TextField, avoiding
  the unused proprietary Google Play Services SMS/autofill dependencies.
- Fork branding, license display and documentation; upstream update checks
  removed entirely because upstream packages lack these modifications.
- Build/reproducibility and dependency license records.
- Serialize first-start log-directory creation before opening log files.
- Reader editing controls own their gestures without disabling normal image
  pan/zoom outside the controls.

